{"schema_version":1,"guid":"6a88164a2b92ab398438722b","apple_collection_id":"1824332089","show":"健康中国","titel":"栗子花生绿豆 肺结节大小与癌变风险","audio":{"url":"https://f3.kroraina.com.cn/loulan/podcast/6864fdcd68380e5779c056a3/2026/08/21/aad30cf22b2b45b8974fee8c0712e875.mp3","user_agent":"PodcastsAM/1.0 (+https://amapps.app)","groesse":9533952,"format":"mp3","geprueft_am":"2026-08-24T09:23:16+00:00"},"faehigkeiten":{"clips":true,"range":true,"kapitel":true,"dynamik":"unbestimmt","grund":"Dynamik weder belegt noch ausgeschlossen: keine Merkmale gefunden, aber eine unveraenderte Wiederholungsprobe beweist nichts"},"einzeiler":"探讨肺结节成因、大小与癌变风险，专家解析如何科学应对。","kurzfassung":"本期节目探讨了肺结节的形成因素与癌变风险。专家指出，肺结节的成因复杂，吸烟并非唯一诱因，厨房油烟、空气污染以及情绪等都会对其产生影响。此外，体检发现的结节95%以上为良性，结节大小与恶性概率呈正相关，需根据不同尺寸采取相应的复查和干预措施。","stichpunkte":["肺结节的成因多样，吸烟只是其中一个因素","室内空气污染、厨房油烟等也会影响肺部健康","长时间生闷气会影响机体免疫机制，导致异物难以排出","体检发现的肺结节95%以上属于良性结节","肺结节大小与恶性概念之间存在正相关关系","小于等于6毫米的结节称为肺微结节，临床干预较少","大于3厘米的病变在医学上被称为肺占位"],"kapitel":[{"titel":"肺结节的成因与影响因素","start":0.58},{"titel":"情绪对肺部健康的影响","start":89.48},{"titel":"肺结节的良恶性与大小关系","start":125.86},{"titel":"肺结节的分类与复查建议","start":256.56}],"clips":[{"hook":"肺结节不只跟吸烟有关","start":23.688,"ende":53.784,"laenge":30.1,"byte_start":758016,"byte_ende":1721087,"bytes":963072,"range_header":"bytes=758016-1721087","vorlauf_s":0.072,"inhalt_start":23.76,"anker_sha256":"1f59a6981ba05472af028948a5793b9a89365502a43cef8924a3a2a2e12e1e9a","einblendung_ms":60,"text":"除了吸烟之外，雾霾、二手烟、装修材料以及做饭时的油烟等，也是导致肺部出现小疙瘩的原因。","anker_ende_sha256":"40d1c418537d4ba18cd574066b664324bc296d4dd18b987647d0b8f84a852e9e"},{"hook":"烹调时如何减少油烟危害","start":65.064,"ende":88.2,"laenge":23.14,"byte_start":2082048,"byte_ende":2822399,"bytes":740352,"range_header":"bytes=2082048-2822399","vorlauf_s":0.072,"inhalt_start":65.136,"anker_sha256":"e0ec1e2f528c749d803759b8ff6919ba0a688fc2c218052e07a2fe9dca49bc9e","einblendung_ms":60,"text":"为了减少烹饪油烟对肺部的危害，烹调时应全程开启抽油烟机，并在菜肴出锅后让其继续运转数分钟。","anker_ende_sha256":"51dc7b09d093351986b3f6d5b94dbb94418e286d1254efe360b6a67b96063708"},{"hook":"95%以上的肺结节是良性的","start":132.336,"ende":152.424,"laenge":20.09,"byte_start":4234752,"byte_ende":4877567,"bytes":642816,"range_header":"bytes=4234752-4877567","vorlauf_s":0.072,"inhalt_start":132.408,"anker_sha256":"223ec77a4ca6e1435c108de62479e6b68c0f753098cc0b85b5f40c24f331bbba","einblendung_ms":60,"text":"体检中偶然发现的肺部小疙瘩绝大多数为良性病变，通常无需特殊干预，对正常生活也没有影响。","anker_ende_sha256":"2fb2075c29fd24495587784d84a9686400fef28aa0632c4db1f2adba80d2cf5c"},{"hook":"结节越长越大，恶性概率越高","start":173.016,"ende":197.232,"laenge":24.22,"byte_start":5536512,"byte_ende":6311423,"bytes":774912,"range_header":"bytes=5536512-6311423","vorlauf_s":0.072,"inhalt_start":173.088,"anker_sha256":"a6b81ee079b2e6ca9eb12f1233d907130f8218fb74884045bb59bce47139289c","einblendung_ms":60,"text":"肺部阴影的体积增大与恶性病变存在直接关联，若直径从数毫米扩展至一厘米以上，则高度警惕癌变风险。","anker_ende_sha256":"a78ca8a6089e53e92f094d50ec08dea6f96acf554359f7acd03354222d80068a"},{"hook":"不同大小的肺结节该如何处理","start":264.024,"ende":292.728,"laenge":28.7,"byte_start":8448768,"byte_ende":9367295,"bytes":918528,"range_header":"bytes=8448768-9367295","vorlauf_s":0.072,"inhalt_start":264.096,"anker_sha256":"ed09c541a8ed068281cb2c39a2003af237ed271fa6ad43deb3b8e274ea6f21ac","einblendung_ms":60,"text":"直径在六毫米及以下的微小病灶无需常规复查，中等大小的可由多学科专家评估，超过一厘米则需考虑手术干预。","anker_ende_sha256":"fae01a1b39775a601cb661aef5fb195346af99d9197c61ff78482482a5425fea"}],"erzeugt":{"am":"2026-08-24T09:23:16+00:00","transkript_modell":"faster-whisper large-v3","transkript_quelle":"whisper","verstehen_modell":"gemini-flash-lite-latest","prompt_version":2},"sprache":"zh","texte_sprache":"zh","texte_herkunft":"erzeugt","dauer":297,"veroeffentlicht":"2026-08-21T09:11:38+00:00","beschreibung":"栗子花生绿豆 肺结节大小与癌变风险","untertitel":"栗子花生绿豆 肺结节大小与癌变风险","bild_url":"https://f3.kroraina.com.cn/loulan/podcast/noChannelId/2025/07/02/b7043fb30e7846e99bdc7f6aa2cc8ded.jpg","folgennummer":1,"kapitel_quelle":"modell"}